#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Qiskit MCP Servers to integrate quantum computing capabilities into AI "
"assistants and agents."
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang mga Qiskit MCP Server para isama ang mga kakayahan sa quantum "
"computing sa mga AI assistant at agent."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers"
msgstr "Mga Qiskit MCP Server"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore modelcontextprotocol  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore modelcontextprotocol  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Servers {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Mga Qiskit MCP Server {#qiskit-mcp-servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit MCP Servers is a collection of [Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) servers that integrate quantum "
"computing capabilities into AI systems. These servers enable AI assistants, "
"large language models (LLMs), and agents to access IBM Quantum&reg; services"
" and Qiskit libraries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Qiskit MCP Servers ay isang koleksyon ng mga [Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP)](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) server na nagsasama ng mga "
"kakayahan sa quantum computing sa mga AI system. Nagbibigay-daan ang mga "
"server na ito sa mga AI assistant, large language model (LLM), at agent na "
"ma-access ang mga serbisyo ng IBM Quantum&reg; at mga library ng Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an open-source project. For the most up-to-date information, detailed API coverage, and advanced configurations, refer to the [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ito ay isang open-source na proyekto. Para sa pinaka-updated na impormasyon, detalyadong coverage ng API, at mga advanced na configuration, tingnan ang [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When should I use Qiskit MCP Servers? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-mcp-"
"servers}"
msgstr ""
"Kailan dapat gamitin ang Qiskit MCP Servers? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-mcp-"
"servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit MCP Servers allow AI assistants to help you with quantum computing "
"tasks, such as the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay-daan ang Qiskit MCP Servers sa mga AI assistant na tulungan ka sa"
" mga gawain sa quantum computing, tulad ng mga sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Creating, manipulating, and transpiling quantum circuits\n"
msgstr "Paglikha, pagbabago, at pag-transpile ng mga quantum circuit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Retrieving and searching Qiskit documentation, guides, and API references\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkuha at paghahanap ng dokumentasyon ng Qiskit, mga gabay, at mga "
"sanggunian ng API\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Answering quantum computing questions directly from reliable sources\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagsagot sa mga tanong sa quantum computing nang direkta mula sa mga "
"mapagkakatiwalaang pinagkukunan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Generating quantum code with contextual awareness\n"
msgstr "Pagbuo ng quantum code na may contextual awareness\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Optimizing circuits using AI-powered transpilation\n"
msgstr "Pag-optimize ng mga circuit gamit ang AI-powered transpilation\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting to real quantum hardware automatically\n"
msgstr "Awtomatikong pagkonekta sa tunay na quantum hardware\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Analyzing and selecting optimal quantum backends\n"
msgstr "Pag-analyze at pagpili ng pinakamainam na quantum backend\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Executing quantum circuits and tracking job status\n"
msgstr "Pagpapatupad ng mga quantum circuit at pagsubaybay sa status ng job\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What is included? {#what-is-included}"
msgstr "Ano ang kasama? {#what-is-included}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following MCP servers are available:\n"
msgstr "Ang mga sumusunod na MCP server ay available:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit MCP Server {#qiskit-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit MCP Server {#qiskit-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides core quantum computing capabilities for local development. This "
"server enables AI assistants to create, manipulate, and transpile quantum "
"circuits, as well as serialize them to formats like OpenQASM 3 and QPY.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay ng mga pangunahing kakayahan sa quantum computing para sa lokal "
"na pag-develop. Tinutulungan ng server na ito ang mga AI assistant na "
"lumikha, magbago, at mag-transpile ng mga quantum circuit, pati na rin "
"i-serialize ang mga ito sa mga format tulad ng OpenQASM 3 at QPY.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime MCP Server {#qiskit-runtime-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime MCP Server {#qiskit-runtime-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides access to IBM Quantum cloud services through Qiskit Runtime. This "
"enables AI assistants to interact with quantum backends, submit jobs, and "
"retrieve results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay ng access sa mga serbisyo ng IBM Quantum cloud sa pamamagitan ng "
"Qiskit Runtime. Nagbibigay-daan ito sa mga AI assistant na makipag-ugnayan "
"sa mga quantum backend, magsumite ng mga job, at makuha ang mga resulta.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Docs MCP Server {#qiskit-docs-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit Docs MCP Server {#qiskit-docs-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides AI assistants with access to the complete Qiskit documentation "
"ecosystem, including SDK module documentation, implementation guides, and "
"best practices. This server enables intelligent retrieval and search across "
"the Qiskit documentation without requiring authentication.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay sa mga AI assistant ng access sa kumpletong ekosistema ng "
"dokumentasyon ng Qiskit, kabilang ang dokumentasyon ng SDK module, mga gabay"
" sa implementasyon, at mga pinakamahusay na kagawian. Nagbibigay-daan ang "
"server na ito sa matalinong pagkuha at paghahanap sa buong dokumentasyon ng "
"Qiskit nang hindi nangangailangan ng authentication.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Server {#qiskit-ibm-transpiler-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Server {#qiskit-ibm-transpiler-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides AI-powered circuit optimization through the [AI-powered transpiler "
"passes](/guides/ai-transpiler-passes). This server enables AI assistants to "
"optimize quantum circuits using advanced routing and optimization "
"algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay ng AI-powered circuit optimization sa pamamagitan ng [mga AI-"
"powered transpiler pass](/guides/ai-transpiler-passes). Tinutulungan ng "
"server na ito ang mga AI assistant na i-optimize ang mga quantum circuit "
"gamit ang mga advanced na algorithm sa routing at optimization.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Community servers {#community-servers}"
msgstr "Mga server ng komunidad {#community-servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following community-contributed MCP servers are also available:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga sumusunod na MCP server na gawa ng komunidad ay available din:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Gym MCP Server {#qiskit-gym-mcp-server}"
msgstr "Qiskit Gym MCP Server {#qiskit-gym-mcp-server}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Provides reinforcement learning capabilities for quantum circuit synthesis "
"using the [qiskit-gym](https://github.com/AI4quantum/qiskit-gym) library. "
"This server enables AI assistants to use RL-based optimization techniques "
"for quantum circuit transpilation and synthesis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay ng reinforcement learning capabilities para sa quantum circuit "
"synthesis gamit ang library na [qiskit-"
"gym](https://github.com/AI4quantum/qiskit-gym). Nagbibigay-daan ang server "
"na ito sa mga AI assistant na gumamit ng mga RL-based na pamamaraan ng "
"optimization para sa transpilation at synthesis ng quantum circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit MCP Servers {#install-qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "I-install ang Qiskit MCP Servers {#install-qiskit-mcp-servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To use Qiskit MCP Servers, you need:\n"
msgstr "Para gamitin ang Qiskit MCP Servers, kailangan mo ng:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.10 or later (3.11+ recommended)\n"
msgstr "Python 3.10 o mas bago (inirerekomenda ang 3.11+)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An IBM Quantum account and API token (see [Set up your IBM Cloud&reg; "
"account](/guides/cloud-setup) for instructions)\n"
msgstr ""
"Isang IBM Quantum account at API token (tingnan ang [I-set up ang iyong IBM "
"Cloud&reg; account](/guides/cloud-setup) para sa mga tagubilin)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install all the available Qiskit MCP servers by running the following "
"command from a terminal:\n"
msgstr ""
"I-install ang lahat ng available na Qiskit MCP server sa pamamagitan ng "
"pagpapatakbo ng sumusunod na command mula sa terminal:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install individual MCP servers:\n"
msgstr "Maaari ka ring mag-install ng mga indibidwal na MCP server:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Qiskit MCP Servers {#configure-qiskit-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "I-configure ang Qiskit MCP Servers {#configure-qiskit-mcp-servers}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set environment variables {#set-environment-variables}"
msgstr "I-set ang mga environment variable {#set-environment-variables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up the required environment variables for authentication. The Qiskit MCP"
" Server and Qiskit Docs MCP Server do not require authentication.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang mga kinakailangang environment variable para sa authentication."
" Hindi nangangailangan ng authentication ang Qiskit MCP Server at Qiskit "
"Docs MCP Server.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For the Qiskit Runtime, or Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Servers:\n"
msgstr "Para sa Qiskit Runtime, o Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Servers:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can find your API token in your [IBM Quantum account "
"settings](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Makikita mo ang iyong API token sa iyong [mga setting ng IBM Quantum "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the MCP client {#configure-the-mcp-client}"
msgstr "I-configure ang MCP client {#configure-the-mcp-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can configure an MCP-compatible client (such as Claude Desktop, Cursor, "
"or other AI tools) to use the Qiskit MCP servers. The exact configuration "
"depends on your client. For example, an MCP client configuration file might "
"look like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang mag-configure ng MCP-compatible na client (tulad ng Claude "
"Desktop, Cursor, o iba pang AI tool) para gamitin ang mga Qiskit MCP server."
" Nakasalalay ang eksaktong configuration sa iyong client. Halimbawa, ang "
"isang configuration file ng MCP client ay maaaring magmukha tulad nito:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Refer to your MCP client's documentation for specific configuration "
"instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sumangguni sa dokumentasyon ng iyong MCP client para sa mga tiyak na "
"tagubilin sa configuration.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test the MCP servers {#test-the-mcp-servers}"
msgstr "Subukan ang mga MCP server {#test-the-mcp-servers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can test the MCP servers interactively by using the MCP Inspector:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong subukan ang mga MCP server nang interactive sa pamamagitan ng "
"paggamit ng MCP Inspector:\n"

