msgid ""
"Visit the [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers) for detailed "
"documentation, API coverage, and examples.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bisitahin ang [Qiskit MCP Servers GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/mcp-servers) para sa detalyadong "
"dokumentasyon, coverage ng API, at mga halimbawa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn about [AI-powered transpiler passes](/guides/ai-transpiler-passes) to "
"understand the AI-powered circuit optimization capabilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alamin ang tungkol sa [mga AI-powered transpiler pass](/guides/ai-"
"transpiler-passes) para maunawaan ang mga kakayahan ng AI-powered circuit "
"optimization.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up your [IBM Quantum account](/guides/cloud-setup) if you haven't "
"already.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang iyong [IBM Quantum account](/guides/cloud-setup) kung hindi mo "
"pa nagagawa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explore the [Model Context Protocol "
"documentation](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) to learn more about MCP.\n"
msgstr ""
"I-explore ang [dokumentasyon ng Model Context "
"Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) para matuto pa tungkol sa MCP.\n"

